# Stricter: tellers now also need the branch network. Expected: REJECTED in
# "equivalent" mode (a decision changed), PROVEN in "non-weakening" mode (it never allows more).
SUBJECT teller, manager, customer
RESOURCE accounts SUPPORTS READ, WRITE
RESOURCE vault    SUPPORTS EXECUTE

ALLOW teller READ accounts WHEN on_shift AND branch_network
ALLOW manager ACCESS accounts WHEN mfa
ALLOW manager EXECUTE vault WHEN mfa AND dual_control
ALLOW customer READ accounts WHEN owns_account
DENY customer WRITE accounts
